Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.65,0:00:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of my hand this instant, sinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.55,0:00:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would rather die than be saved by you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.31,0:00:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not bear the disgrace of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's suicide gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing, that's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.37,0:00:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So suck it up, act like a\Nknight, and quit being an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot! How dare you? A\Ncommon criminal insult me! I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,demand an apology oh shut\Nup i called you an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you're acting\Nlike an idiot idiot listen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.37,0:00:43.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i let go when you die\Nthen what eugio's still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the cathedral and\Nhe's on his way up to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pontifex and it's your\Njob to stop him you idiot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.23,0:00:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,instead of checking\Nout an integrity knight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.63,0:00:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should be thinking how to\Nget back in But not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.49,0:01:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so dumb you forgot your priorities,\Nand that's why you're an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.93,0:01:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.97,0:01:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't allow a rogue like\Nyou to insult me any further.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.35,0:01:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, your words have\Na certain logic to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.13,0:01:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, death is more tolerable\Nthan being saved out of pity,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and letting me fall\Nwould benefit your cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why don't you explain why\NI must accept this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.75,0:01:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try.
