Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.77,0:03:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.81,0:03:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we didn't break in and get this far up the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cathedral just to\Ndestroy the Axiom Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the Dark Territory is\Ngonna invade the Human Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we want to protect it same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one of the most powerful\Nintegrity knights around and if I let you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,die we lose a valuable ally we can't\Nafford that why should I believe you you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:30.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,violated the greatest taboo of all\Nspilling the blood of a fellow human and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:35.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cutting them down that's true but the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.57,0:03:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,axiom church and the\Ntaboo index are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eugeo and I had a good reason\Nto attack Raios and Umber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.73,0:03:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The law slid upper class nobles like\Nthem to whatever they want to innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.25,0:03:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards were gonna rape Ronie\Nand Tiese and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:03:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.81,0:04:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The law is the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crime is a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the people are allowed to decide what
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.19,0:04:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is right and wrong\Naccording to their needs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how will we maintain order in the land?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, Administrator\Ncame up with all the laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.81,0:04:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who decides if she's right or wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.31,0:04:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm such a sinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then how come I haven't been fried\Nby a bolt of lightning by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.31,0:04:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the will of Stacia, and\Nwe knights enforce her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are her divine servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.65,0:04:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you knights in force are lies, and\Nme and Eugeo came here to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.37,0:04:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we defeat Administrator,\Nwe'll enter tyranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we were, I'd have let you fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.43,0:04:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming loose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick your sword in the wall, or we die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine's about to come out! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not save you, sinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.99,0:05:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I returned the favor is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, our duel has yet to be decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, at least we're even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got an idea if you want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.37,0:05:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't hang here all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our arms will get tired, but if we work\Ntogether we can find a way back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So like, what do you say\Nwe call a truce till then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.41,0:05:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A truce? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't break the wall\Nso we'll have to climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be easier if we help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you propose we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If one of us starts to fall, the\Nother stops them, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we had a rope, we could\Nuse it as a safety line.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't bring one, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to admit it, but\Nthat does sound logical.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the moment we set foot\Ninside again, I will cut you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True, sir, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not forget that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said we needed rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.05,0:06:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form object.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.29,0:06:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that the matter conversion art?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.29,0:06:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I changed the shape of an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.97,0:06:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the pontifex can use the formal\Narts to change an object's properties,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:06:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you dolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.77,0:07:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, I just thought of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.25,0:07:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about that dragon of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.09,0:07:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you, like, summon it to come get us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mine cannot fly further than the\Nlanding platforms on the 30th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.71,0:07:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No dragon can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my uncle... Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the commander's is not allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upper floors are off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the birds stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.27,0:07:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pontifex herself made it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.65,0:07:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cast a formal art, one so\Nadvanced I do not even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.29,0:08:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that leaves us\Nwith three options then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go up or down, or bust\Nthrough the wall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third option is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cathedral walls are endowed\Nwith nearly infinite life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.05,0:08:17.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, as you saw, they\Nregenerate quickly. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm thinking we should climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.37,0:08:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know if there's anywhere\Nup top where we can get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.89,0:08:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Morningstar lookout\Nis on the 95th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no walls, just pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can climb up that far,\Nwe can easily get back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we manage to survive the climb and get\Nin, our truce is off, and I will slay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I didn't forget about our deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you okay with climbing up or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.14,0:08:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going up is more practical than down, but\Nhow do you plan on scaling a sheer wall?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.09,0:09:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate metallic element! Wedge shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that safe to stand on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems to be, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate metallic element.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think this will work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just hang there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.25,0:09:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what do you mean you can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can make a wedge, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you're so strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you shouldn't have any problem\Nhoisting - That is not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.85,0:09:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never been in a situation\Nlike this before today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the risk of sounding weak, it is\Nall I can manage to just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.77,0:10:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot climb up onto\Nsuch a slender step.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about if I pull you up to the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would that work for you instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.57,0:10:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, first I'm going\Nto take up the slack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.69,0:10:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ready go
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on and pull your sword out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab the wall to balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.27,0:10:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going to\Nclimb up a little higher now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know when I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be careful. Always.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs62\fnQuadraat-Bold\blur0.5\c&HF4F2F1&\pos(950.98,869.6)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,120,\alpha&H00&)\t(1863,1983,\alpha&HFF&)}M{\alpha&HFF&\t(25,145,\alpha&H00&)\t(1892,2012,\alpha&HFF&)}o{\alpha&HFF&\t(50,170,\alpha&H00&)\t(1922,2042,\alpha&HFF&)}n{\alpha&HFF&\t(76,196,\alpha&H00&)\t(1952,2072,\alpha&HFF&)}d{\alpha&HFF&\t(101,221,\alpha&H00&)\t(1982,2102,\alpha&HFF&)}a{\alpha&HFF&\t(127,247,\alpha&H00&)\t(2012,2132,\alpha&HFF&)}y{\alpha&HFF&\t(152,272,\alpha&H00&)\t(2041,2161,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(178,298,\alpha&H00&)\t(2071,2191,\alpha&HFF&)}J{\alpha&HFF&\t(203,323,\alpha&H00&)\t(2101,2221,\alpha&HFF&)}u{\alpha&HFF&\t(228,348,\alpha&H00&)\t(2131,2251,\alpha&HFF&)}l{\alpha&HFF&\t(254,374,\alpha&H00&)\t(2161,2281,\alpha&HFF&)}y {\alpha&HFF&\t(279,399,\alpha&H00&)\t(2190,2310,\alpha&HFF&)}6{\alpha&HFF&\t(305,425,\alpha&H00&)\t(2220,2340,\alpha&HFF&)}, {\alpha&HFF&\t(330,450,\alpha&H00&)\t(2250,2370,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(356,476,\alpha&H00&)\t(2280,2400,\alpha&HFF&)}0{\alpha&HFF&\t(381,501,\alpha&H00&)\t(2310,2430,\alpha&HFF&)}2{\alpha&HFF&\t(407,527,\alpha&H00&)\t(2340,2460,\alpha&HFF&)}6
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Asuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's your fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet they caught it right\Noff the side of the turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe they brought it. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like a fishing boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.15,0:11:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's got way too many antennas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it a battleship?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have battleships\Nin service anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, Dr. Kojiro, morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:11:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Nakanishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.39,0:12:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's not a warship, is it SDF?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MSDF.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.02,0:12:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Escort Ship is the\Nofficial designation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one out there is the DD-119 Asahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a five-ton general purpose vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.51,0:12:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of two escort ships in service.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her sister's ship is the Shiranui.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, it looks like\Nit's moving away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are the second\Ngeneration of her class.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.45,0:12:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Colonel Kikuoka, I just saw\Nthe Asahi changing course to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't she supposed to stay with\Nus until 1200, day after tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.11,0:12:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.31,0:12:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:12:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,System call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generate Metallic Element.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Generating containers uses up a\Nsignificant amount of sacred power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once Solace sets, we'll be lucky\Nif we can create one bar an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How high up do you think we are now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I think we're already\Npast the 85th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 95th floor is still\Nquite a long way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.49,0:13:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and climbing's gonna be even more\Ndangerous once it's too dark to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something on that ledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.85,0:14:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like statues\Nfrom here, which is odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.57,0:14:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one below can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, they're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe we can rest on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.31,0:14:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like they're about six meter...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.53,0:14:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,six miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need two more bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only need two, Yusei?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.17,0:14:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was saving it for an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.15,0:14:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears this would be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form object.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wedge shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.13,0:14:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, use these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pulling you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.57,0:14:59.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure is one ugly statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:20.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from the Dark Territory!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.55,0:15:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Draw your sword! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.97,0:15:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two more coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atlas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.35,0:16:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're screwed if they attack at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's up with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on as tight as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll apologize later if we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.01,0:16:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, you idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.47,0:16:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.67,0:16:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.61,0:17:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.37,0:17:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.43,0:17:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:21.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering when you'd snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.19,0:17:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what these monsters are?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.51,0:17:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, they are familiars\Nfrom the Dark Territory,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,conjured from lumps of corrupt soil by\Nsorcerers who practice the dark arts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such disgusting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.67,0:17:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call these creatures\Nminions. That figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the holiest place in the land\Nand they're just hanging out on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to know why as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should not be here fouling the\Nvery symbol of all that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe they escaped the\Nnotice of the integrity knights
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to roost on the central cathedral\Nwhere even the birds cannot land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well not if administrator\Nwanted these suckers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.99,0:18:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know why she\Nwould but it's possible
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point it wouldn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.75,0:18:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.41,0:18:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other two are coming around again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is not my first time in battle
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you need assistance with that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.77,0:18:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, I can handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay? I am. I was just thinking\Nhow strange your moves are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are If you performed them\Nat the Midsummer Festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would attract quite an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.87,0:19:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.07,0:19:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been to the\NMidsummer Festival before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was only for commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even kids from the upper-class\Nfamily stayed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at least the ones I was\Ngoing to the academy with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not mention me in the same\Nbreath as those so-called nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.99,0:19:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen it. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have only heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.19,0:19:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the priests must\Nhave told me of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:46.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We Integrity Knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we are prohibited from mingling with the\Ntownsfolk except in the line of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.01,0:19:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.21,0:19:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Minion blood carries disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should wipe it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, could a man\Nbe any more thoughtless?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.97,0:20:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you so uncouth you do\Nnot even have a handkerchief?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,N-no, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.81,0:20:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.93,0:20:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like it washed and\Nreturned before I slay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.97,0:20:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think of it, ever\Nsince I met Kirito two years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.31,0:20:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's always been with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've forgotten what it's like to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.27,0:20:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.69,0:20:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing him, I'm sure he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's probably climbing the\Ntower, looking for a way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.47,0:20:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Along with Alice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 90th Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.53,0:21:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An Integrity Knight is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.13,0:21:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a giant bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.49,0:21:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to stretch before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got back from\Npatrolling the borderlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Riding that dragon nonstop\Nsure does a number on the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haha.
